1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,265
In communication, information acquired
by one participant reached another

2
00:00:04,275 --> 00:00:07,080
and affected the receiver's later response.

3
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:12,480
Controls with interrupted messages
or different content identify its effect.

4
00:00:12,525 --> 00:00:15,240
This demonstrates transmitting
and using information

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,130
between defined participants,

6
00:00:17,205 --> 00:00:19,210
without claiming human conversation.
